    color: any non-black ARC color (1-9 including grey); bars may share colors
  transform:
    for each bar, compute quantity = bar_length
    write the fixed quantity color at (bar_row, marker_col): 2->1 (blue), 3->4 (yellow), 4->9 (maroon), 5->6 (pink)
    quantity is always 2-5; output colors are in {1, 4, 6, 9}
